2026-11-02T00:26:10.9335702Z [36;1m# Note: There is currently no way to distinguish between undefined variables and empty strings in GitHub Actions.[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9336144Z [36;1m# This limitation affects how we handle default values and empty inputs.[0m
