2026-11-02T00:26:10.9341221Z [36;1m[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9341407Z [36;1m  if [ -n "$input_value" ] && [ "$input_value" != "$default_value" ]; then[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9341724Z [36;1m    # If action was provided with explicit input by the caller set that[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9342072Z [36;1m    # Use printf %q to safely escape special characters and prevent command injection[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9342423Z [36;1m    printf 'export %s=%q\n' "$var_name" "$input_value" >> trivy_envs.txt[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9342659Z [36;1m  fi[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9342771Z [36;1m}[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9342874Z [36;1m[0m
2026-11-02T00:26:10.9343052Z [36;1m# Set environment variables, handling those with default values[0m
